Error [E0113]: This value is `Fraction`, but `average` returns Int
  --> tests/ui/return_value_wrong_shape.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     (a + b) / 2
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `average` declares Int as its result, so the value it hands back must be Int
 Fix: `/` on whole numbers makes an exact Fraction; divide with `/%` to get a whole number rounded down
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113

Error [E0113]: This value is String (text), but `names` returns [String]
  --> tests/ui/return_value_wrong_shape.jet:10:5
    |
 10 |     "ana"
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: `names` declares [String] as its result, so the value it hands back must be [String]
 Fix: Wrap the value in a list: `[value]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113

Error [E0113]: This value is Int (a whole number), but `label` returns String
  --> tests/ui/return_value_wrong_shape.jet:14:5
    |
 14 |     n
    |     ^
 Why: `label` declares String as its result, so the value it hands back must be String
 Fix: Put the value in text with interpolation: "{value}"
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113

Error [E0113]: This value is [Int], but `first` returns Int
  --> tests/ui/return_value_wrong_shape.jet:18:5
    |
 18 |     [1, 2]
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: `first` declares Int as its result, so the value it hands back must be Int
 Fix: This is a whole list; hand back one element, or combine the elements into one value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
